sequenceDiagram
    actor Cliente as Cliente (JWT da Lambda CPF)
    participant API as API principal
    participant UC as CreateServiceOrderUseCase
    participant Repo as PrismaServiceOrderRepository
    participant DB as RDS PostgreSQL
    participant Log as Logger (stdout JSON + requestId)
    participant NR as New Relic (Log API)

    Cliente->>API: POST /service-orders (Bearer JWT)
    API->>API: request.jwtVerify() + requireRole("client"|"admin")
    API->>UC: execute({ clientId, vehicleId, services[], parts[] })

    UC->>Repo: findById(client) / findById(vehicle)
    Repo->>DB: SELECT ...
    DB-->>Repo: cliente e veículo (valida vínculo e soft delete)

    UC->>Repo: findById(service) / findById(part) por item
    Repo->>DB: SELECT ...
    DB-->>Repo: serviços/peças ativos (bloqueia se isActive = false)

    UC->>UC: calcula quoteTotalAmount (soma serviços + peças)
    UC->>Repo: create({ ...dados, status: RECEBIDA, quoteTotalAmount })

    Repo->>DB: INSERT service_orders (status=RECEBIDA)
    Repo->>DB: INSERT service_order_items / service_order_parts (snapshot de unitPrice)
    Repo->>DB: INSERT os_status_history (fromStatus=null, toStatus=RECEBIDA)
    Repo->>Log: emit event "service_order.created" { orderId, orderNumber, clientId, quoteTotalAmount, requestId }
    Log-->>NR: log JSON coletado pelo agente/integração New Relic

    Repo-->>UC: ServiceOrderFullRecord
    UC-->>API: ServiceOrderFullRecord
    API-->>Cliente: 201 { orderNumber, status: RECEBIDA, quoteTotalAmount, ... }

    Note over NR: dashboard "volume diário de OS" conta este evento;<br/>dashboard "tempo médio por status" usa os_status_history<br/>a partir da próxima transição (AdvanceStatusUseCase)
